1072:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****     (#) For Abort services based on interrupts (HAL_UART_Abortxxx_IT), a set of Abort Complete Call
1073:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****         (+) HAL_UART_AbortCpltCallback()
