2788:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) UART_AdvFeatureConfig() API optionally configures the UART advanced features
2789:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) UART_CheckIdleState() API ensures that TEACK and/or REACK are set after initialization
2790:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_HalfDuplex_EnableTransmitter() API disables receiver and enables transmitter
2791:Drivers/STM32G0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g0xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_HalfDuplex_EnableReceiver() API disables transmitter and enables receiver
